WEBVTT

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:08.980
Here, take this.

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.130
Listen... Picture it in your mind.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:18.590
Picture yourself big and strong, 
like the warrior in that card!

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:26.530
If you can picture it, one 
day you'll get that strength!

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:30.830
Get strong?

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:43.730
I won't ask you the reason. 
Use it as you please.

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:49.710
You're as unfriendly as ever...

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:51.830
Well, good luck.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:54.030
I owe you one.

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:04.970
Picture it...

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:07.120
Me...

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:12.570
Having obtained strength... 
having gained true power.

00:02:57.950 --> 00:02:59.770
Blaster Dark...

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:04.920
I'm relying on you for the next fight, too...

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:08.630
...my dependable avatar.

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:14.900
Who...?

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:17.950
Who's calling out to me?

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:28.020
Kai's Battle

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:36.510
Please come quickly.

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:41.560
Hey! What are you doing here?

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:44.160
I don't remember inviting you!

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:48.690
Please don't bother about me. I'm 
just meeting someone here.

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:50.610
Meeting someone?

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:53.200
This shop isn't a rendezvous spot!

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:56.450
Oh, what's the harm? No 
need to be so picky...

00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:59.840
More importantly, I'm thirsty!

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:02.410
So... what...?

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:05.420
I'm a customer here.

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:11.000
Here's some coffee!

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:15.890
Instant?

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:24.630
Yeesh! Why'd I even bother making coffee?

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:25.650
Easy, easy...

00:04:25.650 --> 00:04:28.880
Hey, let's close the shop early today!

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:32.220
I'm sure whoever <i>he's</i> waiting for 
can't be anyone we'd want in here.

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:36.430
Oh? I don't dislike the boy myself...

00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:39.700
Huh? You know who it is?

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:41.700
I have a good idea...

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:44.550
I'm not sure whether he'll 
really come, though...

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:46.750
What do you mean?

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:51.010
It seems like Kourin's meddling...

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:53.740
Kourin? Meddling?

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:57.250
Come to think of it, I haven't 
seen her since this morning.

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:01.410
Somebody...

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:03.540
...is calling me.

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:10.670
Kourin?

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:20.720
Come with me, Aichi Sendou.

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:29.490
There you are! I figured you'd be here.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.410
What do you want?

00:05:40.390 --> 00:05:42.990
It pains me to say this, but...

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:45.680
...please! Fight Brother!

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:50.000
I'm asking you, too.

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.710
You know how Aichi's been acting 
strangely lately, don't you?

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:58.250
I'm not saying it's your fault, but...

00:05:59.180 --> 00:06:02.520
Aichi, I can't fight you.

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:07.530
Since then, he...

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:09.820
Aichi's changed!

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:17.310
So if Brother fights you, I'm sure he'll...!

00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:19.180
You don't have to tell me that.

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:24.520
It's why I'm standing here right now.

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:28.140
Sounds like the man of the hour is here.

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:38.490
Kai...?

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:40.730
Go on.

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:41.900
R-Right...

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:47.920
Get your deck out, Aichi.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.710
I'm challenging you to a fight.

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:56.260
Why? Didn't you say you 
weren't going to fight me?

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:58.850
Yeah. So I did.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:02.360
Then you've finally realized how strong I am!

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.850
No, you're weak.

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:08.660
Hey, now...

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:11.030
And I'm going to prove that to you here.

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:15.650
I see. You still think of me like that...

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:18.430
So be it.

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:21.200
After all, you'll learn 
better when you fight me!

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:30.080
I'm counting on you, Toshiki Kai.

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:36.420
I'll show you how strong I am... Kai!

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:42.300
Why can't we watch from next to Brother?

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:45.260
This is their battle.

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:47.710
Let's allow the two of them 
to be in their own world.

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.910
And honestly, it's tough in that field...

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:52.360
Hmmm...

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:54.990
Well, I suppose it's better for 
them not to hear background noise.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:56.130
Yeah, you're right...

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:05.650
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:05.650
Stand up the Vanguard!

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:13.520
That's a Motion Figure System, too?!

00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:18.180
I guess this is what you'd 
call a "fateful fight"...

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:20.770
Fullbau!

00:08:22.590 --> 00:08:23.820
Barcgal!

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:29.460
I don't believe it! That deck...

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:35.690
Yes. That's the Royal Paladin deck 
that Aichi Sendou used to use.

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:39.340
I see. So that's what this is about.

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:44.050
I'm going to show you the true power 
of this deck that you threw away.

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:47.570
Try it, if you think you can!

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:48.800
I draw!

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:52.660
I ride Blaster Javelin!

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:57.100
I activate Fullbau's skill.

00:08:57.100 --> 00:09:00.970
Come to me, my avatar... Blaster Dark!

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:05.830
You call Blaster Dark your avatar, Aichi?

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:15.860
I'm going to come at you 
full-strength until we collide.

00:09:16.460 --> 00:09:20.090
I won't make the same mistake I did then...

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:26.440
Four years ago, I lost my 
parents in an accident.

00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:34.110
In that moment, I lost the ordinary 
life that I'd taken for granted.

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:41.940
An elementary school student 
can't survive on his own...

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:45.410
...so I was taken in by my uncle's family...

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:48.040
...and left this town behind.

00:09:51.930 --> 00:09:55.220
And then... I met <i>him</i>.

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:53.190
Toshiki Kai

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:27.940
This guy is the Vanguard fighter 
that transferred into your class?

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:29.760
That's right.

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:30.890
Name?

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:32.420
Ren Suzugamori.

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:34.310
Not <i>you</i>, that guy!

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:35.380
"Thatguy"?

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:39.380
Umm, I'm pretty sure his 
name wasn't "Thatguy".

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:42.680
It's my fault for asking you.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.240
Forget it. I'll ask him directly.

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:49.220
Who cares what my name is?

00:10:49.220 --> 00:10:50.160
What?

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:54.220
You interrupted my nap because you've 
got business with <i>this</i>, right?

00:10:54.860 --> 00:10:57.650
Huh! You catch on quick.

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:05.960
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:05.960
Stand up the Vanguard!

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:09.400
"The", huh? Cool!

00:11:21.010 --> 00:11:22.400
That's the end of my turn.

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:23.280
Hey!

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:24.540
It's my turn!

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:27.410
Go, Dragonic Overlord!

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:31.390
Burn everything to ashes! 
Eternal Flame!

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:38.650
I lose.

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:42.520
No big deal.

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:46.400
It was no big deal, right?

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:47.570
Who asked you?

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:52.180
So how did it feel to fight him?

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:54.170
I have no complaints.

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:58.520
How about it? Would you 
like to join Foo Fighter?

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:00.530
Foo Fighter?

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:02.880
That's our team.

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:07.040
Although at the moment, it 
only consists of me and Ren.

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:09.330
You know about the Vanguard 
championship, right?

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:12.150
That's a team battle.

00:12:12.150 --> 00:12:16.210
You need at least three 
fighters to compete there.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:18.960
We've been looking for our third 
member for the longest time!

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:21.740
You want me to join your team?

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:25.000
Yeah. I'm Tetsu Shinjou.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:25.980
This is...

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:27.550
...Ren, right?

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:30.080
Yep! I'm Ren Suzugamori.

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:32.720
Well? Will you think about it?

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:35.360
Are you sure you want <i>me</i>?

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.090
I have no gripes about your fighting skill.

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:41.400
More importantly, Ren likes you as a fighter.

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:42.580
What does that mean?

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:44.930
He's kind of weird...

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:48.700
...but anyone he takes a shine to turns 
out to be a good guy, for some reason.

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:54.380
Can I look at that deck?

00:12:54.380 --> 00:12:55.600
Y-Yeah...

00:12:57.230 --> 00:13:00.830
The Vanguard championship, 
huh? Sounds like fun.

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:01.990
Then...

00:13:01.990 --> 00:13:04.690
I'm Kai. Toshiki Kai.

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:06.440
Good to meet ya, Kai.

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:07.240
Same here.

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:11.840
That's not fair! Let me be part of it, too!

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:20.920
We aimed for the championship...

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:25.730
...but back then, Foo Fighter 
definitely wasn't a strong team.

00:13:26.810 --> 00:13:29.320
Tetsu's fighting was still unpolished,

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:35.060
but, most of all, Ren's crazy speech and 
behavior were on display even during fights,

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:37.090
which made me laugh many times over.

00:13:37.520 --> 00:13:41.820
I didn't hate being with those two.

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:44.650
That's right. It was fun.

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:50.240
But those days didn't last long.

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:54.860
Why don't you know that guarding 
isn't going to do you any good?

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:54.640
Vanguard
Club

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:59.880
I told you it was settled from the beginning 
that I was going to win this turn.

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:08.400
Tetsu!

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:10.830
Get a hold of yourself!

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:13.300
Y-Yeah... Kai?

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:16.780
That's the game.

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:26.190
I thought you could fight a little 
better than that. Too bad, Tetsu.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:30.060
Stop it! Don't be like that just 
because you win once in a while!

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:33.580
Once in a while? That's incorrect.

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:34.050
What?!

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:37.460
Tetsu, tell him, please.

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:40.790
Ren is... strong...

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:42.920
And I mean scary strong...

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:45.100
Scary?

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:48.300
Yes. I've been reborn.

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:50.300
What are you talking about?

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:53.790
I can hear the voices of the cards.

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:56.270
The voices... of the cards?!

00:14:56.720 --> 00:15:00.520
I've obtained incredible power, Kai.

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:04.010
Now, no one will ever be 
able to beat me again.

00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:06.430
I've become the strongest fighter ever!

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:18.160
What was the power that Ren got ahold of?

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:20.780
At the time, I didn't know.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:27.110
The only thing I did know 
was that Ren had changed.

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:29.690
Kashiwagi Construction

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:33.460
What's this?

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:35.860
Foo Fighter's headquarters.

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:41.070
I'm going to gather powerful fighters 
from all across the country here.

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:43.630
What's the point of doing that?

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:47.060
Gathering fighters is the first step.

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:51.680
Top-class fighters will fight each other,

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:54.330
and the one who wins will 
be met with the next fight.

00:15:54.900 --> 00:16:01.260
And so on, until only the winners, the chosen few, 
will be invited to join Foo Fighter's top team.

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:06.000
I thought <i>we</i> were Foo Fighter.

00:16:06.510 --> 00:16:11.220
If you want to form a team with me, 
you'll have to win the fights here.

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:15.150
Kai... I know you have it in you.

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:17.560
I see...

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:19.910
I have high expectations for you.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:19.910
Watch Your Head

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:22.750
Together, we can conquer the whole country.

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:24.040
Kashiwagi Construction

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:25.780
Together, we can soar 
to even greater heights!

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:27.800
I refuse.

00:16:31.110 --> 00:16:32.850
Get your deck out, Ren!

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:33.590
Kai...

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:36.110
I challenge you to a fight!

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:43.600
Stand up the Vanguard!

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:52.640
I wanted Ren to remember...

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:56.550
...the Foo Fighter that 
we had been aiming for.

00:16:56.850 --> 00:16:58.690
And those fun days that we used to have...

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:00.290
...but...

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:01.940
Final Turn!

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:10.170
Can you see yourself, fallen on 
the ground of the planet Cray?

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:14.340
What?!

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:19.010
This is...!

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:22.600
What do you think of my image?

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:24.960
This is an image?!

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:29.150
That's right. It's different from 
the one you're always talking about.

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:32.740
Now <i>this</i> is the power 
of the true imagination.

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:35.750
And you're going to lose here...

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:39.520
...to my avatar, Blaster Dark!

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:47.620
Don't foist your images on me!

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:52.200
Enfold everything in midnight with 
your sword of darkness...

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:55.020
...my avatar, Blaster Dark!

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:05.870
Ren!

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:13.660
What's wrong?! Are you okay, Ren?!

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:18.820
Kai... I got stronger, didn't I?

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:30.100
You're leaving.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:32.600
And you're staying, huh?

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:35.940
I can't desert Ren.

00:18:36.650 --> 00:18:37.740
I see...

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:42.860
I walked out on Ren.

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:47.190
No. "I ran away" is more accurate.

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:56.220
And so I returned to this 
town and began living alone.

00:18:57.260 --> 00:18:59.440
Kai! Kai, is that you?

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:02.170
It <i>is</i> you, Kai!

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:06.520
It's me! Miwa Taishi! You 
remember me, don't you?!

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:07.640
Leave me alone!

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:10.140
W-Wait a second, Kai!

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:11.560
Kai, I say!

00:19:12.570 --> 00:19:14.230
I was peeved...

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:17.180
...that I couldn't stop Ren...

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:21.210
...and, more than anything, 
at my own weakness!

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:29.200
If I had beaten Ren then, I might 
have been able to stop him.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:33.430
If only I'd had the power 
to overwhelm Psyqualia...

00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:36.750
I decided to become stronger.

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:39.750
To earnestly seek out power...

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:42.070
And one day...

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:45.430
G-Give me my card back.

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:51.020
What's lost in a Vanguard fight can only 
be regained through a Vanguard fight.

00:19:52.930 --> 00:19:56.240
T-Then, will you fight me?

00:19:56.740 --> 00:19:58.830
Sure, I'm game.

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:03.270
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:03.270
Stand up the Vanguard!

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:12.030
I taught that beginner the rules 
during our lukewarm fight.

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:16.710
Normally, I would've refused.

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:18.340
But...

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:22.270
Stand up, my avatar! I ride...

00:20:22.980 --> 00:20:25.160
...Blaster Blade!

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:33.490
...I was actually enjoying the fight.

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:36.840
Just like back then...

00:20:42.730 --> 00:20:44.290
I had forgotten...

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:49.830
...that Vanguard fights are, by nature, fun.

00:20:51.070 --> 00:20:55.370
You made me remember that... Aichi...

00:20:56.840 --> 00:20:57.740
And yet...

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:04.240
I've gotten stronger, haven't I?

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:05.850
Fight me!

00:21:05.850 --> 00:21:08.330
I'll make you understand 
just how strong I've gotten!

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:10.850
Are you afraid of losing to me?

00:21:13.590 --> 00:21:16.040
I couldn't stop Ren...

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:18.890
...but this time will be different!

00:21:19.260 --> 00:21:23.260
I can't afford to run 
from or lose this fight!

00:21:25.210 --> 00:21:27.730
I ride Young Pegasus Knight!

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.730
I move Barcgal and use her 
skill to call Flogal!

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:40.480
With Gancelot's skill, I add Blaster 
Blade to my hand from the deck.

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:43.280
Blaster Blade...

00:21:44.090 --> 00:21:46.890
Do you remember this card?

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:48.720
Of course.

00:21:49.340 --> 00:21:53.620
It was my former avatar, but I 
threw it away to become stronger.

00:21:54.520 --> 00:21:55.590
Wrong.

00:21:57.670 --> 00:22:02.310
Then and now, your only avatar 
has been this Blaster Blade.

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:08.620
Aichi, this time I'm going to teach you...

00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:11.240
...what true strength is...

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:14.710
...and I'm going to stop you!

00:23:51.110 --> 00:23:54.200
I've gotten stronger! Why 
won't you acknowledge that?

00:23:54.200 --> 00:23:58.190
Aichi... I'm responsible for your 
fixation on getting stronger.

00:23:58.190 --> 00:24:00.580
Not at all. I'm grateful to you, Kai.

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:02.400
You taught me Vanguard...

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:05.800
You made me remember what I'd 
forgotten, the fun of Vanguard.

00:24:05.800 --> 00:24:08.170
I wanted to get closer to you, 
the fighter who's stronger

00:24:08.170 --> 00:24:10.860
and shines more brightly than 
anyone, and look how far I've come!

00:24:10.860 --> 00:24:13.090
Next time: At the End of the Battle...

00:24:13.090 --> 00:24:16.810
I can see Kai on the ground at my feet...

00:24:16.810 --> 00:24:18.780
Now <i>that</i> is an image!
